WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:00.980
The far side.

00:01.664 --> 00:04.830
The first landing on the side of the Moon that never faces us.

00:05.350 --> 00:07.445
From here the Earth is never in the sky.

00:08.034 --> 00:12.580
The small rover that came with it has driven away; only the lander is drawn.
